# ============================================================
# .dockerignore — .NET Clean Architecture + React Frontend
# ============================================================

# ------ .NET Build Artifacts --------------------------------
**/bin/
**/obj/

# ------ .NET Runtime / Tooling ------------------------------
**/.vs/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/.nuget/
**/TestResults/
**/*.nupkg
**/*.snupkg

# ------ Frontend / Node -------------------------------------
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/.cache/
**/coverage/

# ------ Version Control -------------------------------------
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ------ CI / GitHub -----------------------------------------
.github/

# ------ IDE & Editor ----------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# ------ Environment & Secrets -------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# ------ Docker ----------------------------------------------
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore

# ------ OS-Generated Files ----------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db

# ------ Logs & Diagnostics ----------------------------------
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# ------ Documentation & Misc --------------------------------
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
LICENSE
docs/
